Error [jet.OwnerMovedWhileViewed]: `particles[…]` already has a live view that conflicts with `two`
  --> taskgroup_overlapping_write_borrows.jet:13:9
    |
 13 |         two :: &particles[0]
    |         ^^^
 Why: Many read views may overlap, but an exclusive mutable view cannot overlap any other live view
 Fix: Finish using the earlier view before creating this one, or make an owned copy
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0212

Error [jet.ConcurrentCaptureNotOwned]: `two` and `one` can reach the same place at the same time
  --> taskgroup_overlapping_write_borrows.jet:19:13
    |
 19 |             {
    |             ^
 Why: Children of a task group run concurrently, so overlapping places cannot include a write borrow
 Fix: Give the task owned data, freeze it, use `shared`, or borrow provably separate fields
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1101
